==Old English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gem-pro|ang}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*strēlaz}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|ang}} {{term/t|ine-pro|*strē-}}. Cognate with Old Saxon ''strāla'', Middle Dutch ''strael'' (Dutch [[straal]]), Old High German ''strāla'' (German [[Strahl]]). The Indo-European root was also the source of Old Slavic ''strěla'' (Russian {{l|ru|стрела}}).

